    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero",
        "style": "min-height:auto; padding-top:60px;"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🎧 · AI · Guided audio · Step by step"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "How Caresse creates<br><em>your audio experience.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "From setup to listening, see exactly how Caresse generates a unique, personalized and private intimate audio session, every time."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n                </a>\n            <a href=\"#steps\" class=\"cta-ghost\">\n                <span class=\"inline\">See the steps</span>\n                </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Available on iOS & Android · First session on us"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "steps-detail",
        "id": "steps"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "The process"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "An experience generated for you, in 4 steps"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No catalog to browse. Every session is composed on demand, from your choices."
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "steps-detail-list"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-detail-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "img",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "/screens/en/05_android_en.webp",
                    "loading": "lazy",
                    "alt": "Setting up a Caresse session, solo or duo",
                    "width": "1179",
                    "height": "2556"
                  },
                  "html": ""
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "step-detail-num"
                      },
                      "html": "Step 01"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Tell us about your session"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Solo or duo, you choose your mode and set up your profile with a simple alias. You set the setting, the mood you're after, the intensity, and any accessories or practices you'd like included. Nothing is mandatory: every setting stays optional and adjustable."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-detail-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "img",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "/screens/en/07_android_en.webp",
                    "loading": "lazy",
                    "alt": "AI generates a unique scenario for your Caresse session",
                    "width": "1179",
                    "height": "2556"
                  },
                  "html": ""
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "step-detail-num"
                      },
                      "html": "Step 02"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "AI composes your scenario"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "From your answers, Caresse generates a unique scenario — never a pre-written text pulled from a catalog. Your names (or aliases), your preferences and the flow you chose are woven directly into the narration, without going into the technical details of the generation pipeline."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-detail-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "img",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "/screens/en/08_android_en.webp",
                    "loading": "lazy",
                    "alt": "Natural voice and ambient sound generation for Caresse",
                    "width": "1179",
                    "height": "2556"
                  },
                  "html": ""
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "step-detail-num"
                      },
                      "html": "Step 03"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "The voice comes to life"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "The scenario is turned into audio narration by a natural-sounding voice, paired with ambient sound chosen to deepen the immersion. The result is built to be listened to, eyes closed, without needing to look at a screen."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-detail-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "img",
                  "attrs": {
                    "src": "/screens/en/09_android_en.webp",
                    "loading": "lazy",
                    "alt": "Caresse session ready to listen, solo or together",
                    "width": "1179",
                    "height": "2556"
                  },
                  "html": ""
                },
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "step-detail-num"
                      },
                      "html": "Step 04"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Listen, solo or together"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "You're notified as soon as your session is ready, usually within minutes. For solo sessions, headphones are best for full immersion. For duo sessions, your phone speaker works, but a Bluetooth speaker is even better for a shared moment. The experience stays strictly private: it is never public, never shared between users."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "privacy"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Privacy first"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Your biggest guarantee."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "Generating intimate content with AI naturally raises questions. Here's how Caresse answers them, concretely."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "privacy-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "privacy-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🔒</div>\n                <h3>No public sessions</h3>\n                <p>Your generated sessions are never made public or visible to other users.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "privacy-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎭</div>\n                <h3>An alias is enough</h3>\n                <p>No real identity is required to create your profile or start a generation.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "privacy-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🎚️</div>\n                <h3>You stay in control</h3>\n                <p>Intensity, practices, mood: every setting is chosen by you, adjustable at any time.</p>\n                "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "privacy-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🤐</div>\n                <h3>Discreet by default</h3>\n                <p>The app is designed to stay discreet, with no compromising notification or visible content.</p>\n                "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Everything you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is every Caresse session really unique?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Every session is generated on demand from your choices (participants, preferences, intensity, mood): it is never a pre-recorded audio file played back identically."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does the AI really write the whole scenario?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, the scenario is generated by AI from your preferences, then turned into audio narration. There is no library of fixed scripts that Caresse pulls from."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is Caresse available on iPhone?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes, Caresse is available for free on iOS (App Store) and Android (Google Play)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Is my data private?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Your sessions are never public or shared between users. An alias is enough to create your profile: your real data stays yours."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can couples generate a session together?"
                },
                {
